WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.838
Start a new empty ChatGPT chat. (3× speed)

00:00:00.838 --> 00:00:01.203
Choose the workshop book from the computer. (3× speed)

00:00:01.203 --> 00:00:01.715
The workshop book is attached. (3× speed)

00:00:01.715 --> 00:00:07.609
Write the request using the attached book. (3× speed)

00:00:07.609 --> 00:00:07.714
Send the book and the request. (3× speed)

00:00:07.714 --> 00:00:09.714
Read the complete sent prompt.

00:00:09.714 --> 00:00:12.911
ChatGPT generates the interactive activity. (4× speed)

00:00:12.911 --> 00:00:28.346
Explain the three processes, then apply the distinction to scenarios.

00:00:28.346 --> 00:01:18.379
Classify the scenarios and inspect the explanatory feedback.

00:01:18.379 --> 00:01:18.452
Write an independent explanation and compare the feedback.

00:01:18.452 --> 00:01:26.237
Focus the answer field

00:01:26.237 --> 00:01:32.024
Check my explanation

00:01:32.024 --> 00:01:32.907
Restart the lesson for another learner.

00:01:32.907 --> 00:01:38.583
Restart lesson
